1|0@relationships^1440031657#cu8yagt:restlessgrad$:You need a new crush, it's as easy as that. In my mind, you're probably using your brother as a crutch to avoid the possibility of real romance (+ vulnerability, + rejection) you'd get with anyone else. This is very common for teenagers: pick an impossible target and obsess about only them, so that you don't actually have to try with any real possibilities. Time to date some guys at your school. If anyone seems cute, try spending more time with them and eventually asking if they want to hang out one-on-one. Finding someone else to crush on and actively pursuing them is the best cure for your impossible and inappropriate crush.
